{
  "name": "selina — Handover WhatsApp Notify (No Answer) HUTCH",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Selina (Hutch) Handover → WhatsApp\n\nThe Voice Agent (Selina) collects the guest's name + WhatsApp,\nthen POSTs the payload here → we WhatsApp the human agent.\n\n**Before use:**\n1. Replace the scrubbed token in the *Send WhatsApp* node (see n8n UI).\n2. Activate the workflow, then use the **Production** webhook URL in the Voice Agent.\n3. The recipient comes from the payload's human_agent_whatsapp — set\n   HUTCH_HUMAN_AGENT_WHATSAPP in the agent's deploy .env.\n\n**Expected POST body:**\n```\n{\n  \"customer_name\": \"Chanya\",\n  \"customer_whatsapp\": \"94771234567\",\n  \"call_summary\": \"...\",\n  \"human_agent_whatsapp\": \"94770000000\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-31T08:30:00Z\"\n}\n```",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "39b7ad34-f79a-4268-a2b7-4b88816dc86d",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "7eac5da8-8683-453e-8e50-d6bd79f27372",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0bc9e1fd-81b0-4c66-9059-ffa48b148b13",
      "name": "Webhook - Handover",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        464,
        192
      ],
      "webhookId": "7eac5da8-8683-453e-8e50-d6bd79f27372"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101",
              "name": "human_agent_whatsapp",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.human_agent_whatsapp }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102",
              "name": "whatsapp_message",
              "value": "=🔔 *Missed Call — Guest Wants a Callback*\n\nA guest asked to speak with you, but the call wasn't answered. They've left their details:\n\n👤 Name: {{ $json.body.customer_name }}\n📱 WhatsApp: {{ $json.body.customer_whatsapp }}\n🕐 {{ $json.body.timestamp }}\n\n📋 *Call Summary:*\n{{ $json.body.call_summary }}\n\nPlease reach out to them directly. 🙏\n— Selina · Hutch —",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c295a56f-80b1-4692-ab38-43d9d730135f",
      "name": "Build Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
